=== HINT 1 ===
Same pattern as wi01 but use Thread32First / Thread32Next.

=== HINT 2 ===
Filter inside the loop:
  if (te.th32OwnerProcessID != target_pid) continue;

=== HINT 3 (SPOILER) ===
if (Thread32First(snap, &te)) {
    do {
        if (te.th32OwnerProcessID == target_pid) {
            printf("%-10lu %-12ld %lu\n",
                   te.th32ThreadID,
                   te.tpBasePri,
                   te.th32OwnerProcessID);
        }
    } while (Thread32Next(snap, &te));
}
